f` for a menace holder (A.17) |
=== MN l.284
- **Belief.** `believedMenaces(worldState, observerId)` derives, from the observer's arrived records carrying `menaceId`, the latest telling's place (`lastWhereId`), its `eventTick`, and its magnitude as believed might (1 → `modest` · 2 → `capable` · 3 → `strong`; 0 only by garbling → `thin`; a tale cannot tell strong from formidable — the truth is on scrutiny). A court forgets with the rumor TTL (26 / 13 ticks). Omniscient arm: the truth. One more source, never a second belief: where a menace HOLDS A SITE, the courts that SAW it there (THE SITES' `holder.seenBy` rows — the at-hand courts at its arrival, a court whose patrol looked) hold that sighting's might band from the week of the sighting, composed newest by tick with the tellings (§3.3; RULINGS-ROUND4 A.17) [CURED 2026-10-18 (fp-final r4) — A.17 · D-ST-r4's route].
